# Hide symbols from bundled third-party libraries and C++ internals; which mj*
# and _mj* symbols are exported is controlled by MJAPI and -fvisibility=hidden
# (verified by test/mujoco_shared_exports_test.sh).
#
# Mach-O prefixes C symbols with '_', so mj* becomes _mj* and _mj* becomes
# __mj*. Since ld64's -unexported_symbols_list has no negation operator, these
# globs unexport every symbol except _mj* and __mj*:
# Anything not starting with _ (e.g. $ld$... symbols from libclang_rt.osx.a):
[$0-9A-Za-z]*
# Anything starting with _ except _m* and __*:
_[$0-9A-Za-ln-z]*
# Anything starting with _m except _mj*:
_m[$0-9A-Z_a-ik-z]*
# Anything starting with __ except __m*:
__[$0-9A-Z_a-ln-z]*
# Anything starting with __m except __mj*:
__m[$0-9A-Z_a-ik-z]*
